## 🔒 Simulated vs. Live Cloud Configuration

ResuMind AI operates in **Sandbox Sandbox mode** by default when local credentials are blank, making it highly accessible for reviewers.

* **Simulation Sandbox Mode**: You can click **"Instant sandbox preview"** on the login card, or enter any email/password. The frontend will authenticate you locally. If you upload a PDF or DOCX file, the backend will parse it, automatically generate an extremely high-fidelity Gemini AI matching profile locally, and update your interactive dashboard!
* **Live GCP Mode**: Input real Firebase client keys in `frontend/.env` and standard GCP / Gemini environment variables in `backend/.env`. The application will immediately switch to live operations: creating actual records in Firestore, writing PDFs into Cloud Storage, and requesting structured analysis reports directly from live Gemini AI APIs!
